  "summary": "Both records are densely populated and largely traceable to the declared bundle, with strong fidelity on the Dataverse release record (DOI, version, dates, file inventory with checksums, license, governance flags, intended uses, limitations, biases, completeness caveats). Three classes of defect recur. First, cross-source contamination: a substantial body of methodological detail — the GPT-4 Gene Set AI annotation pipeline, the Annotation Jamboree curation process, IMP integrative structure modelling specifics, and the U2OS Nature publication as a dataset-level external resource — is imported from the U2OS multimodal cell maps paper, which both records themselves acknowledge describes a different cell line and different underlying data. Second, temporal misattribution: collection_mechanisms, several preprocessing_strategies, and the March 2024 CodeFest existing_use are drawn from the May 2024 CM4AI preprint's Year 1 status report and are attributed to a June 2026 release they cannot describe; the CodeFest entry is chronologically impossible as a use of this release. Third, full/core structural divergence: the core record carries the file inventory under 'distributions' where the full record uses 'file_collections', carries the condition/cell-type groupings under 'resources' where the full record uses 'subsets', and omits citation, total_file_count, third_party_sharing, and relationships without stated cause — the paired records are not consistent representations of the same referent. Additional issues include constructed fragment URIs presented as resolvable file and subset identifiers, several slots populated with adjacent-field content (sampling_strategies carrying coverage outcomes, collection_timeframes carrying publication dates, confidential_elements carrying commercial licensing terms, machine_annotation_tools carrying a structure-modelling package), and a failure to flag that the reproduced release description asserts MDA-MB-468 Perturb-seq content that the same source's file inventory and embargo notices contradict. Omissions are generally well-judged: the human-subjects, consent, compensation, and DPIA slots are correctly empty given the Human Subjects: No determination, and variables, splits, cleaning_strategies, and imputation_protocols are correctly absent for want of evidence."
